Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lervo no D الم
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.91,0:00:01.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.54,0:01:59.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because he sent Andromon to deal with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.14,0:02:02.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hawkmon took care of that\NTino with no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.90,0:02:04.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How prodigious!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.60,0:02:15.07,Sign,,0,0,300,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{\fad(300,0)}{\fs30\b1}Nanomon of the Labyrinth!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.62,0:02:17.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it, Izzy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.20,0:02:18.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some kind of power generator?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.82,0:02:19.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even better,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.88,0:02:23.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Etemon has hardwired the entire desert,\Ncreating an extensive computer network.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.92,0:02:26.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My guess, this is one of his\Nremote data access terminals.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.74,0:02:28.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great, let's crash it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.86,0:02:30.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It could be a booby trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.96,0:02:34.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it is, Edimons, I say we cross\Nthe wires and mess it up good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.86,0:02:36.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you going to do with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.82,0:02:38.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.04,0:02:42.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's entirely possible that our\Ncomputers have compatible systems.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.90,0:02:45.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if they do, I can tap\Ninto Edimons' network.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.02,0:02:47.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you have mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.60,0:02:49.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, that was quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.80,0:02:51.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who even knows I've logged on?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.26,0:02:52.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, it's Etemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.74,0:02:55.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Open it, it's probably just spam. Right.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:55.82,0:02:58.40,Sign,,0,270,120,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord0}{\fs30\b1\c&H000000&}HELP ME{\i1}!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.64,0:02:57.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.60,0:02:59.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,S-O-S! Mayday!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.44,0:03:00.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm being held prisoner!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.30,0:03:04.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help me escape, and I'll guide\Nyou to the crest you seek!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.52,0:03:06.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think he's for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.16,0:03:07.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, who could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.80,0:03:10.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean the system's down?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.96,0:03:13.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to hear any excuses.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.56,0:03:15.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want those stinking kids located now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.82,0:03:18.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, a mighty Etemon, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.76,0:03:20.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Most majestic royal one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.48,0:03:24.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The problem is, we got a glitch\Nat the Pyramid host computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.18,0:03:26.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Datamon
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.34,0:03:30.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get me there in a hurry You ploppy\Near little freaks Let's roll
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.32,0:03:32.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.23,0:03:35.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't like this I don't like it one\Nlittle bit I don't like the look of
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.32,0:03:38.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't like the smell of it. I don't\Nlike it. Don't have a brain cramp.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.44,0:03:41.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe, you're turning green\Naround the edges. Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.46,0:03:45.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,somebody asked for our help We\Ngotta at least check it out, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.34,0:03:48.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,According to my laptop We\Nshould be getting close
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.88,0:03:51.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look! It's glowing!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.10,0:03:54.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.24,0:03:55.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TK, come over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.26,0:03:58.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look what I found! Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.76,0:03:59.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Another crest!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.30,0:04:05.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.56,0:04:14.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.58,0:04:15.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My own crest!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.82,0:04:17.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.44,0:04:21.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now TK, don't think this means\Nyou get to stay up any later.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.08,0:04:23.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sora's crest is the only one left to find.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.46,0:04:26.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe if we rescue this\Nguy, he can lead us to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.08,0:04:27.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, what are we waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.60,0:04:28.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To the rescue!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.62,0:04:29.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Da-da-da-da-da!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.66,0:04:30.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.30,0:04:36.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See these hieroglyphs?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.72,0:04:37.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look familiar?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.32,0:04:41.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is definitely the same\Nwriting we've come across before.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.82,0:04:42.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.34,0:04:44.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a new one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.98,0:04:47.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.44,0:04:49.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prodigious!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.35,0:04:50.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.27,0:04:51.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know what I'm thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.92,0:04:53.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got a feeling\Nyou're going to tell us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.66,0:04:54.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you see,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.57,0:04:57.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's quite possible that these hieroglyphs\Nare not a form of writing at all,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.76,0:04:58.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but rather code,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.18,0:05:00.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,computer code.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.20,0:05:03.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you change a piece of the\Ncode, then you change the program.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.56,0:05:06.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, like that, for example.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.36,0:05:08.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.02,0:05:11.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you telling us that this\Nwhole place is some kind of
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.58,0:05:14.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,giant computer game and that\Nnone of it is really real?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.78,0:05:18.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's real, all right.\NHuh? Huh? You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.92,0:05:22.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking that everything we\Nsee and everybody we meet in this
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.22,0:05:25.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,place are actually pieces of data\Nor programming given physical form.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.80,0:05:26.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.80,0:05:30.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're writing this whole thing's one\Nbig computer, then how did we get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.58,0:05:32.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did we squeeze in\Nthrough the floppy drive?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.62,0:05:34.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, we're just kilobytes of data, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.90,0:05:36.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, the versions\Nof us that are in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.98,0:05:41.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'm just data, why do I still\Nfeel like I'm flesh and blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.34,0:05:43.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I still have to go to\Nthe little girl's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.80,0:05:44.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't really.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.71,0:05:45.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just think you have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.94,0:05:47.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, I hope you're right, cuz...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.46,0:05:50.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's the real us, our\Nflesh and blood bodies?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.16,0:05:50.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.52,0:05:54.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose we're back at\Nthe campground still. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.56,0:05:57.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we're alive back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.98,0:06:00.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We exist simultaneously\Nwith our other selves.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.66,0:06:03.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're in a parallel digital\Nuniverse like the Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.66,0:06:06.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does that mean I don't have to worry\Nabout brushing my teeth anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.76,0:06:09.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got bigger things\Nto worry about now, TK.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.82,0:06:12.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although, do us all a favor\Nand don't stop brushing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.54,0:06:13.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.82,0:06:15.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.08,0:06:17.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.10,0:06:18.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.76,0:06:21.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me see if I can just\Ncorrect this program.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.10,0:06:25.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh, he's in computer dark mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.54,0:06:26.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This could take a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.34,0:06:31.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.54,0:06:34.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've called up a holographic\Nmap of the DigiWorld.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.40,0:06:37.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can see how physically\Nsimilar it is to the planet Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.52,0:06:40.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, there are a lot of\Nparallels with our world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.60,0:06:42.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's terrific, Izzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.10,0:06:44.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great time for a geography lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.96,0:06:47.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pay attention and you\Nmight learn something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.52,0:06:48.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:48.05,0:06:53.01,Sign,,0,270,120,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord0}{\fs30\b1\c&H444845&}HELP ME{\i1}!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.43,0:06:51.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I enter the email address\Nof the person who contacted us,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.74,0:06:54.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can find his location\Nin the DigiWorld here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.32,0:06:56.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, look.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:55.56,0:07:00.52,Sign,,0,356,160,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord0}{\fs90\b1\c&H444845&}LP ME{\i1}!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.46,0:06:59.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That email address is from\Na web domain in our world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.34,0:07:00.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've logged on to it a thousand times.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.00,0:07:02.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there a point to this somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.44,0:07:05.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is the person who sent the message\Nin our world or the DigiWorld?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.02,0:07:08.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's just the thing, isn't both.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.44,0:07:10.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, the DigiWorld's on the left.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.60,0:07:12.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The world we know is on the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.18,0:07:14.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if I overlay them like so...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.32,0:07:17.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The white lines match up perfectly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.22,0:07:18.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does it mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.40,0:07:21.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reminds me of the balls of yarn\Nmy kitty used to play with.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.68,0:07:23.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the world's digital network.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.72,0:07:27.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through those lines, every computer on\NEarth is connected to every other computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.60,0:07:31.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The digi-world is a physical embodiment\Nof the data passing through them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.26,0:07:33.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guys, we're seeing something\Nnobody else has ever seen,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.06,0:07:35.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that nobody even knows about,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.82,0:07:39.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the digital shadow world that\Nexists alongside our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.08,0:07:41.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And they're not just parallel,\Nthey're physically linked.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.72,0:07:44.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so anything we do here will\Nhave effects on the other.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.94,0:07:45.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.06,0:07:47.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Intense.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.97,0:07:49.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and here's the coolest part.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.08,0:07:51.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wherever this person is in the DigiWorld.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.00,0:07:55.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I can take us there just by entering\Nhis email address and clicking on it,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.70,0:07:57.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like accessing a web page.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.28,0:08:02.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, all this techno\Ntalk's making my head Spin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.74,0:08:05.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Computer guys can never\Njust do something, TK.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.60,0:08:06.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That'd be too easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.04,0:08:10.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They gotta spend all day\Ntelling you how they'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.10,0:08:11.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is depressing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.52,0:08:14.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even when on computer\Ndata I have allergies.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.12,0:08:15.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look on the bright side, Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.72,0:08:18.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you weren't here, you\Nnever would have met me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.18,0:08:21.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sarah, does this mean that we don't exist?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.88,0:08:23.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That we're really not friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.56,0:08:24.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.28,0:08:29.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This may be a make-believe world, but that\Ndoesn't mean our friendship isn't real.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.80,0:08:32.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Truthfully, I don't get\Nit, but it sounds right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.08,0:08:32.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.99,0:08:36.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wherever we are, we're here, so let's\Nfigure out what we're going to do next.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.68,0:08:39.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Brainiac, what\Nare you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.88,0:08:41.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.79,0:08:45.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I have to do is click on the\Nguy's email address and then bingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.70,0:08:47.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate bingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.32,0:08:50.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so confusing with all those\Ndifferent letters and numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.56,0:08:52.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look, a door.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.78,0:08:55.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, last one\Nthrough is a rotten egg.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.90,0:08:58.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our electronic pen pal is right out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.70,0:09:00.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or it could be a trap. No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.10,0:09:03.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're just bits of data, so I\Nuploaded us as file attached.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.94,0:09:05.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.46,0:09:09.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, check this out
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.00,0:09:13.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heads up, Etemon at 9 o 'clock
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.76,0:09:18.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it, it's the dumpster for\Nyou, Etemon, you old pile of junk
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.82,0:09:23.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, I think I left the water\Nrunning back at the Sphinx
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.68,0:09:28.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, Tai, you're relieved. It's\Nour turn to stand watch. Finally,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.34,0:09:32.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's not much fun watching\Na bunch of rocks Uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.68,0:09:34.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,goodnight I thought being in a computer
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.96,0:09:37.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,cartoon adventure would\Nbe more fun than this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.08,0:09:38.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,About tomorrow. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.12,0:09:40.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.48,0:09:42.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That Etemon is bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.62,0:09:45.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it really worth it just\Nto find my crest? Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.02,0:09:47.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Sora.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.16,0:09:47.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Piece of cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.07,0:09:51.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm looking forward to spinning\Nthat ugly monkey around by his tail.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.68,0:09:55.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, come on. Snap out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.08,0:09:56.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.16,0:10:01.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, if it was my crest or TK's or\Nanyone else's we were going after,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.12,0:10:03.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know you wouldn't\Nhesitate for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.92,0:10:06.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, maybe you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.40,0:10:09.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just after what Izzy said. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.08,0:10:12.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean all that stuff\Nabout us being nothing but
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.62,0:10:15.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,little kilobytes in the great\Ncomputer program of life?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.94,0:10:20.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It just makes us seem so small and\Ninsignificant, like nothing we do really matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.24,0:10:22.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course it matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.40,0:10:24.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't take the chance that it doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.12,0:11:04.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,at computer copies so\Nwhatever happens we have to
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.38,0:11:06.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be just as careful as if\Nwe were still our physical
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.04,0:11:10.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,selves hey sometime this\Nyear man you guys talk
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.86,0:11:14.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,more than my mom's book\Nclub can we go all right
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.98,0:11:28.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i got into the program and found the most\Ndirect route to the center of the pyramid
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.32,0:11:30.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, now, let's get this straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.04,0:11:34.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're only going in there to find this\Nguy and get Sora her crest, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.18,0:11:35.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.09,0:11:38.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means no fights or\Nadventures or dangerous stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.16,0:11:39.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You whimper more than my puppy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.62,0:11:41.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt, Mimi, TK, stay here and stand guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.06,0:11:42.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.18,0:11:46.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you really don't think you\Nneed me, I miss you guys already.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.72,0:11:49.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be back in time to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.48,0:11:50.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or get eaten.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.12,0:11:59.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See ya guys, come back as soon as you can
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.34,0:12:10.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, keep together
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.64,0:12:15.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a hidden back door\Nto the program we could
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.74,0:12:18.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,use to get in It should be\Nsomewhere right up ahead
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.42,0:12:24.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's funny it should\Nbe right here where's
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.42,0:12:26.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my fried banana sandwich you know i like
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.50,0:12:31.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to eat after my nap Tai\Nwhat is it it's Etemon
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.88,0:12:37.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who's there what do
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.14,0:12:39.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we do now quiet beomon
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.34,0:12:44.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boo great. Now I'm hearing things.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.62,0:12:49.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you know i'm gonna have to have this
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.84,0:12:55.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,place completely exterminated because\Nsomething's starting to bug me
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.66,0:13:02.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we've got him talking to\Nhimself really funny Tai are
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.92,0:13:06.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you crazy what if you'd gotten\Nus caught But we weren't,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.08,0:13:06.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,were we?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.99,0:13:08.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, now that we're in, what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.96,0:13:11.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess next we try to find\Na way through these walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.52,0:13:13.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The trick is finding the weak points.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.44,0:13:14.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I found one!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.70,0:13:21.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As I was saying, Agumon, the\Ntrick is finding the weak points.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.08,0:13:22.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's use heads, not hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.96,0:13:28.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.00,0:13:30.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can see right through this wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.68,0:13:31.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.68,0:13:33.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's another breach in\Nthe system's security.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.72,0:13:35.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look, Gazimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.22,0:13:38.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be still.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.34,0:13:44.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's the big idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.04,0:13:45.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.95,0:13:46.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't give me that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.87,0:13:48.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just cause the boss likes me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.32,0:13:49.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you gone nuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.48,0:13:50.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.18,0:13:59.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could have gotten us all\Ncaptured back there, Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.58,0:14:00.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're so immature!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.10,0:14:03.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you yell a little quieter, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.40,0:14:05.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gee, Sora, relax, kid. Get a grip.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.78,0:14:07.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who elected you the\Nqueen of the fun police?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.04,0:14:10.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, this is tons of fun, and\Ngetting caught will be a blast.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.58,0:14:11.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Couldn't you just pass notes?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.82,0:14:12.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's much quieter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.70,0:14:19.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This looks nasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.14,0:14:22.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't have to go through here, do we?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.80,0:14:25.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This firewall's the system's\Nlast line of defense,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.16,0:14:27.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but there appears to be only\None safe way through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.60,0:14:30.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if we pick the wrong way,\Nthey'll scoop us up with a spatula.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.74,0:14:32.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not scared, are you, Joe?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.08,0:14:33.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe I am a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.16,0:14:36.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Relax, it's not like\Nwe're human or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.64,0:14:38.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're just bunches of kilobytes, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.70,0:14:42.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The wait point should be... here. Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.90,0:14:48.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you coming in or are you\Njust gonna stand there all day?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.18,0:14:51.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.80,0:15:01.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the host computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.74,0:15:02.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yowza.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.98,0:15:06.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think it comes with a\NCD-ROM drive, or is that optional?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.86,0:15:09.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what do you suppose that thing is?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.02,0:15:11.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've heard of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.20,0:15:14.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His name's Datamon, a\Nsuper-intelligent robotic Digimon.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:12.18,0:15:19.18,Sign,,0,170,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Nanomon
Dialogue: 1,0:15:12.18,0:15:19.18,Sign,,350,0,200,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Perfect
Dialogue: 1,0:15:12.18,0:15:19.18,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Machine Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:15:12.18,0:15:19.18,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Type
Dialogue: 1,0:15:12.18,0:15:19.18,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Virus
Dialogue: 1,0:15:12.18,0:15:19.18,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:15:12.18,0:15:19.18,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Plug Bomb
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.94,0:15:17.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He disappeared without\Na trace some time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.26,0:15:19.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody ever knew what happened to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.38,0:15:21.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe that's the thing\Nthat sent us the email.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.52,0:15:22.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It kind of looks like he's a prisoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.04,0:15:23.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.95,0:15:24.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who else?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.58,0:15:27.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today is your lucky day. And mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.44,0:15:29.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.35,0:15:32.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's communicating with us through\Nthe infrared port on my laptop.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.26,0:15:34.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, a hardware fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.36,0:15:36.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, listen, we haven't much time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.88,0:15:42.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Long, long ago, I bought Etemon and lost\None of my rare miscalculations. Anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.18,0:15:45.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was severely damaged\Nand he imprisoned me
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.48,0:15:47.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,here and forced me to\Nact as his webmaster,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.98,0:15:49.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,administering his network.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.56,0:15:51.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Without Etemon knowing, however,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.80,0:15:54.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was able to slowly repair myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.64,0:15:57.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,restoring my capabilities\Nbit by bit over the years.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.92,0:16:01.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eventually, I gained control\Nover Etamon's network.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.44,0:16:05.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not total control, but enough to bring\Nsome misery to that blubbering baboon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.56,0:16:10.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At last, I'm ready to free myself, but\NI need your help to break the cyberlock.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.36,0:16:11.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about my crest?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.54,0:16:14.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said in your message\Nthat you could lead us to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.48,0:16:16.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, yes, whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.38,0:16:18.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just please, help me out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.66,0:16:21.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can we trust this talking can opener?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.00,0:16:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Etemon is your enemy as well as mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.46,0:16:25.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That makes us allies.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.96,0:16:27.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, you're my only hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.08,0:16:29.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, you're on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.22,0:16:30.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you need from us?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.28,0:16:33.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am transmitting instructions\Nfor disengaging the cyberlock.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.42,0:16:36.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, push that lever\Nfor me, would you, Tai?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.74,0:16:37.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.54,0:16:41.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right three, left five.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.90,0:16:44.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quickly, quickly, before Etemon returns!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.50,0:16:45.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then push the button.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.60,0:16:49.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, Tai, pull the lever\Nback to its original position.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.34,0:16:51.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That should be the last\Nstep in the process.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.44,0:16:52.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.22,0:16:54.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Etemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.22,0:16:57.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been watching you on surveillance\Ncameras, and you're an annoying little brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.56,0:17:03.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know that fucking troublemaker!\NHey, it's been my pleasure. Great, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.70,0:17:06.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't you just call him ugly too\Nall this time i thought it was just
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.72,0:17:09.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,snot-nosed kids who were causing\Nmy network to go on the but it was
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.84,0:17:12.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you wasn't it you digital dumpster
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.16,0:17:18.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,well in a word yes you\Nrat Digivolve, help out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.38,0:17:26.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon, digivolve to... Greymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.46,0:17:32.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tentomon, digivolve to...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.14,0:17:34.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kabuterimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.10,0:17:39.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Flymon, digivolve to...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.02,0:17:41.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vegiemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.80,0:17:44.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gomamon, Digimon, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.20,0:17:47.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.70,0:17:49.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.42,0:17:53.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Golemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.52,0:17:57.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm free!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.74,0:18:01.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now let's see how you like it! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.18,0:18:03.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wee! Ha-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.14,0:18:07.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.00,0:18:11.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, we set you free!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.48,0:18:14.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I do appreciate that,\Nyou chumps. Dumb kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.64,0:18:20.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll think by now they'll\Nlearn to trust no one. Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.60,0:18:21.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This will hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.78,0:18:24.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dark red world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.42,0:18:30.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beelborn, over here. Huh? I'm coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.00,0:18:32.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, so much for no fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.52,0:18:36.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beelborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.78,0:18:39.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tough luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.84,0:18:41.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like I won again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.58,0:18:43.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not over yet, monkey breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.56,0:18:46.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.47,0:18:49.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With their powers harnessed to my own,\NI'll be more than a match for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.68,0:18:50.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.72,0:18:54.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back here, you bratty little... Sora!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.10,0:18:57.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.78,0:19:01.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've gone back out\Nthrough the firewall.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.86,0:19:02.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.77,0:19:04.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The weak point was here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.66,0:19:05.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.57,0:19:07.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me get back online so I can find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.48,0:19:09.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't have time for that, Izzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.08,0:19:10.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What can happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.64,0:19:11.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't the real me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.04,0:19:14.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't test theories now\NPain still hurts, Tai
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.10,0:19:17.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Joe
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.26,0:19:19.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you thinking, Tai?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.86,0:19:21.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're in a video game?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.08,0:19:23.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing can happen to us because\Nthese aren't our real selves here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.04,0:19:25.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, something like that Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.52,0:19:28.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,think again Our digital selves\Nare directly linked with
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.32,0:19:31.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,our other selves back home You\Nneed to be a lot more careful
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.80,0:19:33.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No telling what may happen
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.60,0:19:35.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean if I...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.88,0:19:38.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If something happens here It happens there
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.92,0:19:42.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,move the weak point is one meter to your
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.30,0:19:45.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right no way just one\Nfalse move and it's over
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.70,0:19:50.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hey Tai it's safe Tai we\Ncame through it all right
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.28,0:19:53.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on the way in yeah but\Nthen i didn't know that
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.20,0:19:57.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,go on it's okay come on Tai we're wasting
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.38,0:20:01.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,time sora needs us what's wrong with you
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.92,0:20:04.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.72,0:20:14.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sorry we held them as long as we could\Nnow to finish off you kids and put an
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.24,0:20:17.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,end to your annoying interference what
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.02,0:20:22.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,would you care for some needle spread
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.68,0:20:29.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,howling blaster come on let's move\NTai what's wrong with you come on
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.64,0:20:38.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no not again they didn't get away again i'm\Nhaving an extremely bad day baby i don't
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.34,0:20:42.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,get it when the creep grabbed sora and\NBiyomon why didn't you go through the firewall
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.68,0:20:47.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,after them i couldn't i couldn't move it's\Nnot your fault we're all in this together
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.88,0:20:54.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai we'll find a way to get them back\Nit's all my fault sora it's all my fault
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.66,0:21:07.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're in the wind, you\Ncan see the light on the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.64,0:21:13.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you're in the wind,\Nyou can't see the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.60,0:21:18.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.42,0:21:25.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.32,0:21:28.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.36,0:21:31.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to show you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.36,0:21:36.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to see you all right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.36,0:21:41.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.32,0:21:46.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to wear a jacket.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.84,0:21:49.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to see you soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.62,0:21:53.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to see you soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.88,0:22:58.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next time, Digimon\NAdventure: MetalGreymon.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.66,0:23:01.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, the adventure has evolved.
